        skos:definition        "A beach closure might occur anytime there is a known sewage or chemical spill impacting ocean waters. when water contact may cause humans to become ill. When a beach is closed, a public agency advises beach users to avoid all contact with ocean water in the closure area and where closure signs are posted."@en;
